meta {
  name: start the STT model download
  type: http
  seq: 3
}

post {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/stt/model/download
  body: none
  auth: none
}

docs {
  Fetch the sha256-pinned whisper model (ggml-small.bin) into ~/.spectro/models; the digest is verified before the file is put in place, so a half or wrong download never becomes a usable-looking one. Idempotent start; answers the same status object as GET /api/stt/status.
  
  CAUTION: Downloads ~488 MB — do not include this in an automated replay.
  
  Fence: host+origin — Loopback fence plus Origin check: an Origin header, if present, must be loopback. REST clients send no Origin header, which counts as safe — requests pass. A manually added foreign Origin answers a blank 404.
  
  Writes state: yes
}
